# WS5-02/03/06 for the 2.0+ optional services under vamos. Sources:
# spec/appendix-stdlib.md §14.4-§14.5 (tag lists, date stamps, signal semaphores) and
# the utility/exec autodocs (AllocateTagItems/FreeTagItems, InitSemaphore,
# ObtainSemaphore/ReleaseSemaphore, AttemptSemaphore returns TRUE when obtained).
# Expected: "9 2", "true", and nothing left open or allocated.
# Detector: probe.py --vamos-leaks (library left open or orphan AllocMem memory).
profiles: hosted-amiga
expect: output
contrast: tagSet(borrow t, 0x80000002, 9); ==> tagSet(borrow t, 0x80000002, 8);
contrast-expect: output
--- output
9 2
true
--- contrast-output
8 2
true
